IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ptx-owner-occupier`

-- Property Tax Act 1960, s 9(2) owner-occupier rates as published by IRAS -- worked cases. Every assertion is a claim about the
-- ENCODING, not the law; the rate order itself was not retrieved.

§ `REQ-0010 (cradle-to-grave-simone e072)`

-- An owner-occupied HDB flat with an annual value of $12,000 for 2032: nil (0% on the first $12,000).
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 12000 2032 EQUALS 0

§ `IRAS worked examples (tax for 2026 on the rates from 1 January 2025)`

#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 12000 2026 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 36000 2026 EQUALS 960
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 84000 2026 EQUALS 5480

§ `The cumulative column of each IRAS table`

#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 40000 2025 EQUALS 1120
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 50000 2025 EQUALS 1720
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 75000 2025 EQUALS 4220
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 85000 2025 EQUALS 5620
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 100000 2025 EQUALS 8620
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 140000 2025 EQUALS 19020
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 150000 2025 EQUALS 22220

#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 30000 2024 EQUALS 880
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 55000 2024 EQUALS 2980
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 100000 2024 EQUALS 11980

#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 40000 2023 EQUALS 1380
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 100000 2023 EQUALS 8730

#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 55000 2020 EQUALS 1880
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 130000 2022 EQUALS 9380

§ `The same flat in earlier years`

-- $12,000 in 2024: 4% on $4,000 above $8,000 = $160; the same in 2015 to 2023.
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 12000 2024 EQUALS 160
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 12000 2023 EQUALS 160
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 12000 2018 EQUALS 160
#ASSERT `the owner-occupier property tax` 8000 2024 EQUALS 0
